      "content": "You might be experiencing irritation from volatile organic compounds or nutrients released by the system. Since the source is your neighbor's property, directly treating the air is difficult, but you can try running an air purifier with a HEPA filter and an activated carbon filter indoors. These filters are effective at trapping particulates and absorbing many airborne chemicals. If the symptoms persist or worsen, it is best to contact your local environmental health department for advice.",
