      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is possible highly concentrated or volatile substances are being aerosolized, and sharp headaches are a serious symptom that warrants professional attention. Instead of trying to block specific molecules from the outside, focus on creating a stronger barrier between your property and theirs. Consider installing a physical barrier, such as dense, tall landscaping or a privacy screen, which can help diffuse or block direct mist flow toward your home. Given the severity of your reaction, consulting a medical professional is crucial for proper diagnosis.",
